      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i5: Once the materials are received from the supplier, the goods are issued and the motorcycles are produced."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to receiving materials followed by issuing goods and producing motorcycles."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i6: At the same time, the stock is updated and the motorcycles are dispatched."
      ],
      "justification": "The AND branch enforces the concurrent execution described, while the two actions correspond to the simultaneous tasks."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
